 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.9-rc28 — Staff Dashboard & alerts
+
+- **Staff tab:**
+  - Check in and out for duty and see who's on now. Shifts left open over 12 hours close themselves.
+  - "Need staff here" requests, optionally with your location. Everyone on staff gets a desktop alert and can claim it with "I'm on it".
+  - A staff overview showing time on duty, cases opened, assigned and closed, case updates, average first response, notes, recruits checked and help answered. It's deliberately not a ban leaderboard. Managers see the whole team; everyone else sees themselves.
+  - What's waiting: approvals, open help requests and unassigned cases.
+- **Flagged-user alerts:** if someone with an open case, or a high-severity case a partner group shares with you, is in your instance, UWX tells you (desktop + in-app). It's a reason to check, not to act.
+- **Case alerts:** you're notified when a case is escalated or critical, or when a case assigned to you changes.
+- **Event Mode recaps** are shared with all staff through UnderWeb, and Trends shows everyone's events.
+- **Direct access:** group owners can give specific people access by UnderWeb username, which is how partner groups add their own moderators.
+- **Fix:** staff names now show properly on cases, recruiting and the access log (account profiles are private).
+
 ## 0.6.8-rc27 — Group Intelligence & Moderation Center
 
 - **Group Intel tab** (group staff and UnderWeb staff): live member and online counts, pending requests, invites and bans from VRChat. Member growth over 24 h, 7 d, 30 d and all recorded, built from snapshots. Joins, leaves, kicks, bans, role changes and instances by period, compared with the period before. Live group instances (with a "full" alert), charts with date filters, an activity feed with search, sort, filters and CSV export, and Road to 500. Every number is labelled Current, Historical or Estimate, and anything VRChat won't give you says Unavailable and why.
